<title>QATAR: Qatar's Attiyah says would support OPEC rollover.</title>
<headline>Qatar's Attiyah says would support OPEC rollover.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar's Energy and Industry Minister Abdullah bin Hamad al-Attiyah said on Monday he would support a rollover of the current OPEC production ceiling when ministers next meet in Vienna in June.</p>
<p>&quot;I would be happy with a rollover,&quot; Attiyah told Reuters at a gas conference in the Qatari capital Doha.</p>
<p>OPEC's current ceiling is 25.03 million barrels per day, but its members are producing in excess of the ceiling, according to independent assessments.</p>
<p>Attiyah said Qatar's oil production capacity currently stood at 520,000 barrels per day.</p>
</text>
